{"id":"torrey:benjamin-tribe-of","source":"torrey","name":"Benjamin, Tribe Of","slug":"benjamin-tribe-of","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended from Jacob’s twelfth son — Ge 35:18.","refs":[["Gen",35,18,35,18]]},{"text":"Predictions respecting — Ge 49:27; De 33:12.","refs":[["Gen",49,27,49,27],["Deut",33,12,33,12]]},{"text":"To number the people. — Nu 1:11.","refs":[["Num",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"To spy out the land. — Nu 13:9.","refs":[["Num",13,9,13,9]]},{"text":"To divide the land. — Nu 34:21.","refs":[["Num",34,21,34,21]]},{"text":"Strength of, on leaving Egypt — Nu 1:36,37.","refs":[["Num",1,36,1,36],["Num",1,37,1,37]]},{"text":"Formed the rear of the third division of Israel in their journeys — Nu 10:22,24.","refs":[["Num",10,22,10,22],["Num",10,24,10,24]]},{"text":"Encamped on west side of the tabernacle under the standard of Ephrain — Nu 2:18,22.","refs":[["Num",2,18,2,18],["Num",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"Offering of, at dedication — Nu 7:60-65.","refs":[["Num",7,60,7,65]]},{"text":"Families of — Nu 26:38-40.","refs":[["Num",26,38,26,40]]},{"text":"Strength of, entering Canaan — Nu 26:41.","refs":[["Num",26,41,26,41]]},{"text":"On Gerizim said amen to the blessings — De 27:12.","refs":[["Deut",27,12,27,12]]},{"text":"Cities and bounds of inheritance — Jos 18:11-28.","refs":[["Josh",18,11,18,28]]},{"text":"Celebrated as bowmen and slingers — 1Ch 12:2.","refs":[["1Chr",12,2,12,2]]},{"text":"Assisted against Sisera — Jdj 5:14.","refs":[["Judg",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"Oppressed by the Ammonites — Jdj 10:9.","refs":[["Judg",10,9,10,9]]},{"text":"Almost annihilated for protecting the men of Gibeah — Jdj 20:12-48.","refs":[["Judg",20,12,20,48]]},{"text":"Remnant of, provided with wives to preserve the tribe — Jdj 21:1-23.","refs":[["Judg",21,1,21,23]]},{"text":"Furnished the first king to Israel — 1Sa 9:1,2,15-17; 10:20,21; 2Sa 2:8-10.","refs":[["1Sam",9,1,9,1],["1Sam",9,2,9,2],["1Sam",9,15,9,17],["1Sam",10,20,10,20],["1Sam",10,21,10,21],["2Sam",2,8,2,10]]},{"text":"Adhered for a time to the house of Saul against David — 2Sa 2:9,15,25,31.","refs":[["2Sam",2,9,2,9],["2Sam",2,15,2,15],["2Sam",2,25,2,25],["2Sam",2,31,2,31]]},{"text":"Some of, assisted David — 1Ch 12:1-7,16.","refs":[["1Chr",12,1,12,7],["1Chr",12,16,12,16]]},{"text":"Revolted from the house of Saul — 2Sa 3:19.","refs":[["2Sam",3,19,3,19]]},{"text":"Some of, at David’s coronation — 1Ch 12:29.","refs":[["1Chr",12,29,12,29]]},{"text":"A 1000 of, with Shimei came to meet David on his return to Jerusalem — 2Sa 19:16,17.","refs":[["2Sam",19,16,19,16],["2Sam",19,17,19,17]]},{"text":"Very numerous in David’s time — 1Ch 7:6-12.","refs":[["1Chr",7,6,7,12]]},{"text":"Captains appointed over — 1Ki 4:18; 1Ch 27:12.","refs":[["1Kgs",4,18,4,18],["1Chr",27,12,27,12]]},{"text":"Remained faithful to Judah — 1Ki 12:21.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,21,12,21]]},{"text":"Furnished an army to Jehoshaphat — 2Ch 17:17.","refs":[["2Chr",17,17,17,17]]},{"text":"Numbers of, returned from the captivity and dwelt at Jerusalem — Ezr 1:5; Ne 11:4.","refs":[["Ezra",1,5,1,5],["Neh",11,4,11,4]]},{"text":"Ehud. — Jdj 3:15.","refs":[["Judg",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"Kish. — 1Sa 9:1.","refs":[["1Sam",9,1,9,1]]},{"text":"Saul. — 1Sa 9:1; 10:1.","refs":[["1Sam",9,1,9,1],["1Sam",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"Abner. — 1Sa 14:51; 17:55.","refs":[["1Sam",14,51,14,51],["1Sam",17,55,17,55]]},{"text":"Elhanan. — 2Sa 21:19.","refs":[["2Sam",21,19,21,19]]},{"text":"Paul. — Php 3:5.","refs":[["Phil",3,5,3,5]]}],"refCount":53}
